  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive). Pattern: X⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{乱|みだ}れる.\nTransitive pair: ⟦{乱|みだ}す→乱す：11412_midasu⟧ (to disturb, to throw into disorder)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{乱|みだ}れて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates a resulting state: \"is in disorder/disrupted.\"\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦ダイヤ→ダイヤ：00032_daiya⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{乱|みだ}れる: train schedule is disrupted\n- ⟦{髪|かみ}→髪：02196_kami⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{乱|みだ}れる: hair becomes messy\n- ⟦{心|こころ}→心：01321_kokoro⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{乱|みだ}れる: to feel disturbed\n- ⟦{秩序|ちつじょ}→秩序：10591_chitsujo⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{乱|みだ}れる: order is disrupted",
